# Design anti-patterns — do not introduce these

This rule fires on every edit to `app/` and `components/`. Check each item before saving.

## 🚫 Undefined / ghost tokens — NEVER USE

These tokens do NOT exist in `globals.css` and will silently resolve to transparent:

- ~~`--bg-card-elevated`~~ — use `--bg-elevated`
- ~~`--text-on-accent`~~ — use `text-white` on `--accent` backgrounds
- ~~`--border-focus`~~ — use `ring-(--accent)/20`

The `-dim` and `-muted` aliases are now both defined. Prefer `-muted` in new code; `-dim` is kept for backward compatibility.

## 🚫 Color anti-patterns

```
❌ bg-[#4f46e5]                    ✅ bg-(--accent)
❌ style={{ color: "#b91c1c" }}    ✅ className="text-(--danger)"
❌ bg-[rgba(79,70,229,0.1)]        ✅ bg-(--accent-dim)
❌ bg-black/25  (modal scrim)      ✅ bg-black/40
❌ bg-black/30  (modal scrim)      ✅ bg-black/40
```

Exception for vendor logos in sidebar only: `AWS #232F3E`, `Fly.io #7B36F6`.

## 🚫 Typography anti-patterns

```
❌ <h1 className="text-3xl ...">    ✅ text-2xl font-medium font-(family-name:--font-display)
❌ <h2 className="text-base ...">   ✅ text-sm font-semibold
❌ text-[1.05rem]                   ✅ use named scale or text-sm/text-base
❌ font-sans (raw Tailwind)         ✅ font-(family-name:--font-sans)
❌ font-mono (raw Tailwind)         ✅ font-(family-name:--font-mono)
```

## 🚫 Component structure anti-patterns

```
❌ rounded-2xl on cards             ✅ rounded-xl
❌ rounded-md on buttons            ✅ rounded-lg
❌ rounded-full on action buttons   ✅ rounded-lg
❌ shadow-xl on cards/modals        ✅ shadow-sm
❌ bg-(--bg-field) on modal/header  ✅ bg-(--bg-elevated)
❌ bg-(--bg-surface) on inputs      ✅ bg-(--bg-field)
```

## 🚫 Interaction / state anti-patterns

```
❌ bg-(--success) as primary CTA    ✅ bg-(--accent) text-white hover:opacity-90
❌ bg-(--danger) as primary CTA     ✅ only for destructive confirm buttons
❌ bg-(--warn) for disabled state   ✅ bg-(--bg-muted) text-(--text-muted)
❌ hover:bg-(--accent)/90           ✅ hover:opacity-90 (on bg-(--accent) buttons)
❌ ring-1 on inputs                 ✅ focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-(--accent)/20
❌ outline-none alone               ✅ focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 ...
```

## 🚫 Spacing anti-patterns

```
❌ px-6 on topbar/header            ✅ px-8 to align with main content
❌ gap-4 sm:gap-5 (responsive gap)  ✅ gap-4 (single scale value)
❌ p-5 on run cards                 ✅ p-4
❌ px-5 py-4 on regular cards       ✅ p-4 for run cards; px-5 py-4 for stat cards only
```
